### APIKEY rejects missing header
GET /secret/data
=> 401

{"error": "UNAUTHORIZED"}

### APIKEY rejects wrong key
GET /secret/data
X-Api-Key: wrong
=> 401

{"error": "UNAUTHORIZED"}

### APIKEY accepts valid key
GET /secret/data
X-Api-Key: s3cr3t
=> 200

{"classified": true}

### RATELIMIT allows request 1 of 2
GET /limited/ping
=> 200

{"ok": true}

### RATELIMIT allows request 2 of 2
GET /limited/ping
=> 200

{"ok": true}

### RATELIMIT rejects request 3 of 2
GET /limited/ping
=> 429

{"error": "TOO MANY REQUESTS"}
